      "statement": "limedl-native depends on limedl-core with the aria2-rpc feature, compiles the FemtoVG/OpenGL renderer plus Slint's software rasterizer as a runtime fallback when GL initialization fails, and enables tokio's signal feature for the cfg(unix) SIGTERM/SIGINT watcher.",
