      "statement": "Every target in .cargo/config.toml carries --cfg reqwest_unstable, required by reqwest's HTTP/3 feature; desktop x86_64 targets set target-cpu=x86-64-v3, the NAS musl entries use x86-64-v2 or no CPU flag, and the desktop Linux release reuses the gnu entry via cargo zigbuild --target x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.2.17.",
